      "sha256": "48cbe10763faf2005f7b477b7026870a8ade9eb50f4819421d389f932271c5a8",
      "matches": [
        {
          "line": 6,
          "text": "routers and independent of OTLP export. `api.profiling.uri` and"
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "text": "`controller.profiling.uri` default to empty (disabled). An enabled URI must"
        },
        {
          "line": 58,
          "text": "`observability.otlp.uri` (environment: `GITSTORE_OBSERVABILITY__OTLP__URI`) to"
        },
        {
          "line": 65,
          "text": "`make compose OBSERVABILITY=otel` adds the pinned local observability stack and"
        },
        {
          "line": 97,
          "text": "`observability.otlp.trace_sample_ratio`"
        },
        {
          "line": 213,
          "text": "All three services accept `--config-file <path>`. The flag selects the file"
        },
        {
          "line": 219,
          "text": "**`gitstore-api` and `gitstore-controller-manager` only**: `--config-file` may"
        },
        {
          "line": 221,
          "text": "`--config-file base.toml --config-file overlay.toml`. The first occurrence is"
        },
        {
          "line": 225,
          "text": "\u2014 it only accepts a single `--config-file`."
        },
        {
          "line": 278,
          "text": "**Explicit file**: `gitstore-api --config-file /path/to/config.toml` (required when selected). Repeat the flag to layer overlays: `--config-file base.toml --config-file overlay.toml` (later file wins per key)."
        },
        {
          "line": 357,
          "text": "| `api.auth.serviceaccount.signing_key` | `GITSTORE_API__AUTH__SERVICEACCOUNT__SIGNING_KEY` | PEM private key | (empty) | **Yes, when a service-account provider is chained** | **Yes** | API-only Ed25519 or ECDSA P-256 access-token signing key |"
        },
        {
          "line": 362,
          "text": "Never put `api.auth.serviceaccount.signing_key` in a configuration file mounted by"
        },
        {
          "line": 438,
          "text": "`api.datastore.scylla.auto_migrate = false` (environment:"
        },
        {
          "line": 440,
          "text": "image's `gitctl migrate --hosts scylla:9042 --keyspace gitstore --timeout 5m`"
        },
        {
          "line": 445,
          "text": "The operator must create the keyspace first. `gitctl migrate` uses the same"
        },
        {
          "line": 462,
          "text": "| `api.datastore.scylla.auto_migrate`              | `GITSTORE_API__DATASTORE__SCYLLA__AUTO_MIGRATE`                | boolean         | `true`           | No       | No        | Run startup schema migration automatically     |"
        },
        {
          "line": 644,
          "text": "| `--config-file <path>` | string | Load config from this path instead of `gitstore.toml` |"
        },
        {
          "line": 681,
          "text": "**Explicit file**: `gitstore-controller-manager --config-file /path/to/config.toml` (required when selected). Repeat the flag to layer overlays: `--config-file base.toml --config-file overlay.toml` (later file wins per key)."
        },
        {
          "line": 693,
          "text": "| `controller.serviceaccount.uid`                    | `GITSTORE_CONTROLLER__SERVICEACCOUNT__UID`                     | string   | (empty)                             | **Yes**          | No        | Enrolled ServiceAccount UID; prevents identity reuse after deletion |"
        }
      ]
    }
